All live jobs (~50,000)
   │
   ├─ Stage 1: Hard filters (category, geo, language, budget range)
   │           → ~5,000 jobs pass
   │
   ├─ Stage 2: Subscription-tier gating (Pro sees everything;
   │           free users see jobs older than 24h)
   │           → variable, often 2,000–4,000 jobs visible
   │
   ├─ Stage 3: Soft scoring (relevance, past performance, freshness,
   │           saturation, fit score)
   │           → all visible jobs get a rank score
   │
   └─ Stage 4: Pagination (top 50–100 shown on first page)
              → only top-ranked jobs get eyeballs
